{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#card-zh","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 是面向 DSH Web 的文件上下文插件。它在输入框工具栏添加本地文件选择按钮，并在输入框上方显示可移除的附件条；浏览器将文本文件同步给宿主，宿主通过命令保存附件并在每条直接用户消息后把文件内容加入模型上下文。图片使用 DSH 的草稿图片附件流程。文本附件最多 10 个，每个最多 256 KB，会话总量最多 1 MiB；不支持无法解码的二进制文本。适合需要让模型参考本地文档、代码或日志的 Web 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:145-187","lib/client.js:270-323","lib/index.js:91-111"]}
{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#card-en","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach adds local files to DSH Web context. Choose text files in the composer and remove them from the attachment strip. The host injects contents after direct user messages; images use DSH attachments. It allows 10 files, 256 KB each and 1 MiB total. No key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:145-187","lib/client.js:270-323","lib/index.js:91-111"]}
