{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#feature-1","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 的功能「选择文本文件」：用户可从 Web 输入框的添加文件按钮选择本地文本文件，插件读取其 UTF-8 内容并同步到宿主；单文件上限为 256 KB，同时最多 10 个。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:145-187"]}
{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#feature-2","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 的功能「注入文件上下文」：宿主在每轮直接用户消息之后加入附加文件内容，让模型在回答时读取这些内容；附件总内容预算为 1 MiB。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-70","lib/index.js:102-110"]}
{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#feature-3","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 的功能「查看和移除附件」：输入框上方显示当前文本文件名芯片，用户点击芯片上的叉号即可从当前会话附件列表中移除文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:232-266"]}
{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#feature-4","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 的功能「添加图片附件」：选择图片时使用 DSH 会话的草稿图片接口创建图片附件并加入输入消息，不将图片作为文本内容读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:145-165"]}
{"unit_id":"TestTheBoy__dsh_plugin_file_attach#feature-5","repo":"TestTheBoy/dsh_plugin_file_attach","commit":"c1fa73cded30e1e4776a3629fa6f67f502c1478c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-file-attach 的功能「移除聊天记录污染」：宿主命令关闭输入记录，并把附件内容作为冻结的上下文消息追加，因此文件正文不进入会话聊天历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:77-100","lib/index.js:52-70"]}
